NAME
    sprites - dump the active sprite/OBJ table

SYNOPSIS
    sprites

DESCRIPTION
    Lists every active sprite reported by the attached core: index, X/Y
    position, width and height, tile index, palette, priority, and
    horizontal/vertical flip flags.

EXAMPLES
    sprites

EXIT STATUS
    0   Sprite table printed.
    1   No target attached or session service fault.

SEE ALSO
    tile(1), tilemap(1), pal(1), regs(1)
